# PWA / sheets

Read `docs/pitfalls.md` (keyboard / viewport / SW / share) before changing these files.

- Size overlays with `visualViewport` (see `FullScreenSheet`). Do not rely on `100vh` alone.
- Focus / trap effects: depend on **`open` only** (+ refs). Never list `onClose` in those deps.
- Lock/unlock via `fullScreenChrome`; tests call `resetFullScreenChromeForTests`.
- Share: `navigator.share` → blob download → `window.open` preview. Never `location.assign(blobUrl)`.
- Do not register the service worker in development.
